---
// Home 4 Enterprise Infrastructure & Security Bento Grid
---

<section id="infrastructure" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#0D0E15] border-b border-white/5 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-800/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-purple-300 mb-4">
        <span>Enterprise Foundation</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Engineered for security, <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-400 via-indigo-300 to-purple-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">scale, and zero downtime.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Enterprise infrastructure that protects customer data, guarantees delivery, and supports high-volume throughput.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid (4 Pillars in Dark Glass) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-7 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Bento Item 1: Meta Official Cloud API Partner -->
      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-8 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            📱
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Direct Meta WhatsApp Cloud API</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Direct, official API connection to Meta infrastructure. Enjoy verified green badge support, zero rate-limit throttles, and 99.99% message deliverability.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-400">Official Meta Partner</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-300">Zero Downtime Migration</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 2: SOC-2 Type II & Data Privacy -->
      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-8 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            🔒
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">SOC-2 Type II & GDPR Compliant</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            All customer conversations and CRM records are encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256). Includes granular role-based access control (RBAC).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-950/60 text-purple-300">SOC-2 Certified</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-300">GDPR & HIPAA Ready</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 3: Realtime Collision Prevention -->
      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-8 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-950/80 border border-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Microsecond Collision Locks</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Realtime WebSocket locking prevents multiple reps from drafting contradictory replies simultaneously. Private internal notes keep conversations clear.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-indigo-950/60 text-indigo-300">WebSocket Live Sync</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-300">Internal @Mentions</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Item 4: Multi-Location Google Sync -->
      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-8 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
            ⭐
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Multi-Location Reputation Sync</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Manage reviews across 10 to 500 Google Business Profile and Trustpilot locations from a centralized dashboard with automated post-service review triggers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-950/60 text-amber-300">Multi-Location Sync</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-300">1-Click AI Responses</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
